{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "6497c1980636e5bdae3c0648d38a498520bb93910975155c5789e25f4d9421bb", "ja": "そっか。でも、得意なことでも、\nうまくいかない時はあると思うぞ。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，就算是擅长的事情，我觉得也会有进展不顺利的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "32a3566ea047a1c6701909ed9889a2df567065f800c4fe7501937c168a75a2d4", "ja": "そうよ。たまたま運が悪かっただけかもしれないし、\nそんなに落ち込むことないわ。", "zh": "是啊。也许只是碰巧运气不好，没必要那么沮丧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9bbfff152e10d94977097c0414a2f0185d30a7011e8ec7385e631257adc4f252", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！\nあれ？　まだ全員揃ってなかったか。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n咦？人还没到齐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "a7efc57ea23533d8bc7cc3a2279088c78028b0ec43fc219e36bd82a17e7cf556", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n{$P$}も、瑞希を励ましてあげてよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n也请让{$P$}鼓励一下瑞希吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1005_p", "source_sha256": "61be2e7fd6b1e333a573034b87906b8ee506b79a66df4084f1b4ee165c4f2796", "ja": "え？　瑞希、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "咦？瑞希，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "89bc16fc52214a83ea513c4fdc20d6b3e46e7f5646815e72823371de516d6a87", "ja": "社長とカードで勝負して、負けたんですって。\nそれですごく落ち込んでるのよ。", "zh": "听说她和社长用纸牌比赛，结果输了。\n所以现在非常沮丧呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "31fbbf70b840daca1c3a114017fcea8f24eeaa6788c5a397667772d48e3a5da5", "ja": "最初は手品で対決をしたのですが、勝負がつかず。\nそこで、ポーカーで対決をすることに。", "zh": "一开始是用魔术对决，但分不出胜负。\n于是就改成了用扑克牌对决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1008_p", "source_sha256": "db900256970de49a064bc32ba6f925e5a4d6da6caafbd173c96ee480dddb8280", "ja": "なるほど。それで瑞希が負けたのか……。\nポーカーも、瑞希の得意分野だもんな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以瑞希输了吗……。\n扑克也是瑞希擅长的领域嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "4a924a7163b1cc4008508bf8deb2cc7774dfb548e69bbd0644df73315736c6b4", "ja": "はい。ポーカーなら勝てると思っていたので。\nどうして負けてしまったのか、自分でも不思議です。", "zh": "是的。我原以为在扑克上能赢的。\n可为什么会输掉呢，连我自己都觉得不可思议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "ac41a338c4a3a26b29a289d763b598e1d6e7a2309ccdb38ecbd7b51aff7b38de", "ja": "そうね……。でもポーカーって、\n駆け引きが大事なゲームなんでしょ？", "zh": "是啊……不过，扑克是很看重心理博弈的游戏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "9f810b5ea924ad24db427c0cd6596f95396dfd3c5503b9e1834eb38da1fffc93", "ja": "だったら、瑞希の表情で、\n手札がバレちゃったんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "既然这样，会不会是从瑞希的表情里，看出她手里的牌了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "fe5d3a4bcaab000bf51ab56380bc491d9b11852a6fe6143b5da412556837e0c2", "ja": "私の表情で、ですか？", "zh": "是因为我的表情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "51b4939c296ae110fd47cf1e3f525e9043530abd0b0727074e23809d13642831", "ja": "ええ。最近の瑞希、前に比べて、\nよく笑うようになった気がするもの。", "zh": "嗯。最近的瑞希，比起以前，好像更常笑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "3b6bab4abfbab8752a4f47ae617b2062190c8230c0272701c101745b3e29691c", "ja": "そう言われれば、そうかも？\n自分も、瑞希は笑顔が増えたって思うぞ。", "zh": "这么一说，好像确实是这样？  \n我也觉得，瑞希的笑容变多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "6bc0cc165a9950f6b553eb2b1f34579ab81c040fdf397b21cb4066fb6c90657a", "ja": "そっか、それで負けちゃったのかもね……。", "zh": "这样啊，所以才会输掉的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "8973328a310f1b45d0db8ac8ecfc8e747f49f5f2ad198c1875af44b73ff74fdd", "ja": "でも、前より感情がわかりやすくなったって\nことでしょ？　いいことじゃない。", "zh": "不过，也就是说，你比以前更容易让人看懂感情了吧？这不是好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1018_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "006dac6b31c89b41c0bbeb3bb5a851877dc80f21e63f9c7c8f7259edc60a20db", "ja": "ごめんなさ～い！　\n遅くなっちゃいました～！", "zh": "对不起～！\n来晚了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1996d37b97c4b96b1738d7ec923bc8cfd1bb2971da8215fdcad5efce995dadd6", "ja": "撮影が長引いてしまって……。\nお待たせしてしまったでしょうか？", "zh": "拍摄拖得有点久……让你久等了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1021_p", "source_sha256": "01a6179105297a0c04d2e27baf4308f025b4267e86e560be23c29ee82a6e52a9", "ja": "いや、俺もさっき来たばかりだから大丈夫だよ。\nこれで全員揃ったな。", "zh": "没事，我也才刚到不久，没关系的。\n这下大家都到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f2bbe733c37e8cd9e7cb340ad62de60f1cda12385c146c737fa3b6f011379b4d", "ja": "それじゃ、ミーティングを始めよう！\n次の定期公演は、瑞希の新曲お披露目だな。", "zh": "那么，开始开会吧！\n下一场定期公演就是瑞希的新歌首次亮相了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "f04b2ac88b61dd45475e9e159e9816536285d6b52a3a09e05eca62fd70cc7b61", "ja": "あ、はい。\n新曲、とても楽しみです。……ワクワク。", "zh": "啊，好的。\n我很期待新歌……好激动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f785aee73c131bd5677e1203b9289004b49b6d8fc0906f245b29037b15fb1216", "ja": "前回の真壁さんのソロは、とてもクールでしたね。\n今回はどのような曲なのか、私も楽しみです。", "zh": "上次真壁小姐的独唱非常酷呢。\n这次会是什么样的歌曲，我也很期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6581ef2916e96295392005f5c45e49410da274154c63d888d134520cb5f81c5b", "ja": "あっ、わたしも気になる～！　ねえねえ\n{$P$}さん、どんな曲なんですか？", "zh": "啊，我也很好奇～！那个那个，{$P$}先生，是什么样的歌呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9215e0e586bc1967cca8bf7fc9d2fc72f7403c78800e77cd410a5d438c55c13b", "ja": "紬の言うとおり、前回がかっこいい曲だったからな。\n今回はかわいい感じでいこうと思ってるんだけど……。", "zh": "正如紬所说，上一首是很帅气的歌曲。这次我想走可爱风，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "eaedce34a4ca8959feba64c83fa9d57a31338f38d8f6eab793eda0e97bba0854", "ja": "かわいい曲……。", "zh": "可爱的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1f2319f3be6a485127b994cf91d726f631383988e0735fcfb3475fc6af34ebf8", "ja": "せっかくだから、みんなにも聴いてもらおうか。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，要不要也让大家听听？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "13e06b0b14274e4b25a00f3b913857d76c7f678359dccbecfa57e96ba4c15e76", "ja": "わ～、カワイイ♪　いいなぁ瑞希ちゃん、\nわたしも、次はこんな曲が歌いたいな～。", "zh": "哇～好可爱♪ 真羡慕瑞希，我下次也想唱这样的歌～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7bd250566b2ee21f430d0f41d715d2f78e7377932adfb3475e2834878b76cd73", "ja": "真壁さんには、クールなイメージがありますが。\nこういった可愛らしい曲も、素敵だと思います。", "zh": "我觉得，真壁小姐给人一种很酷的印象。\n不过，像这样可爱的歌曲也很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "9c151faaf2050dd9f446e9776dd1a31a98df4a8b6dedaf3e90f126a8a38971b9", "ja": "はっ。……。", "zh": "哈………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "83655488453a0c1eeb55abdc4a3ffea265c8d0357e5e35eeb62b308fdf508fa9", "ja": "……？　真壁さん、どうかされましたか？", "zh": "……？真壁小姐，请问你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1034_p", "source_sha256": "768a3bdc8acbebb804fdd734c0dabd6947fa56f11934f4936184d49ae5407958", "ja": "瑞希、何か気になることがあるなら、\n遠慮せず言っていいんだぞ。", "zh": "瑞希，如果有什么在意的事，尽管说出来，不用顾虑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "bcc8cfca1c9769cc1b11904a10081bb9ad31038086d44fa1f16d06f431f3977c", "ja": "そうよ、瑞希のソロ曲なのよ？　気になることが\nあるなら、遠慮しないで言っておいたほうがいいわよ。", "zh": "是啊，这是瑞希的独唱曲吧？要是有什么在意的事，还是别客气，说出来比较好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "37f737f1f94e70645411fc56d922a8b73f845518d5bcc2246d64969663f59991", "ja": "いえ、大丈夫です。なんでもありません。", "zh": "不，没关系的。什么事也没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1037_p", "source_sha256": "05e0e1fb731df2b52fce8398ad0e8c190edd79db144b1754f24aed48354abaf5", "ja": "そうか？　ならいいけど……\n相談があるなら、いつでも乗るからな。", "zh": "这样啊？那就好……\n如果有什么烦恼，随时都可以来找我商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1038_p", "source_sha256": "3362c2603404125d4a4b6a879f2fa7381369207e91b09ac763eb322209ac0827", "ja": "それじゃ、今日はこれで終わりにしよう。\nすぐにレッスンも始まるから、よろしくな！", "zh": "那今天就到这里吧。\n马上也要开始训练了，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_112_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "fd360cfe71813ff771d423a8810cc71502eb197297e300acb9e0dc3f373129cc", "ja": "はい。\n……。", "zh": "好的。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
